<%- include('partials/head') %>

<div class="landing">

  <!-- Header -->
  <header class="landing-header">
    <span class="landing-logo">Ultra Claude</span>
    <div class="landing-header-actions">
      <a href="/docs/setup" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm">Docs</a>
      <a href="/getting-started" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Get started &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <main class="landing-main">
    <div class="landing-hero">
      <h1>Spec-driven development for Claude Code</h1>
      <p>Claude Code is powerful for prototyping. Ultra Claude makes it powerful for production &mdash; a specification layer where documentation governs code growth and agent teams coordinate execution.</p>
      <div class="landing-cta">
        <a href="/getting-started" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Get Started &rarr;</a>
        <a href="/docs/setup" class="btn btn-outline btn-lg">Documentation</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Features -->
    <div class="landing-features">
      <div class="landing-feature">
        <div class="landing-feature-icon">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/><polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Spec-Driven Building</h3>
        <p>Documentation governs code growth. Architecture docs exist before code is written. When code diverges from specs, you fix the spec first.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="landing-feature">
        <div class="landing-feature-icon">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Agent Teams</h3>
        <p>Each task gets a dedicated Executor, Reviewer, and Tester. They coordinate autonomously &mdash; writing code, enforcing standards, and validating against product docs.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="landing-feature">
        <div class="landing-feature-icon">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20"/><path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Cache-First Knowledge Base</h3>
        <p>External library docs, patterns, and market research are fetched once and committed as first-class project documentation under <code>documentation/technology/research/</code>. The <code>/uc:research</code> skill is cache-first: repeated lookups across plans hit the cache instantly, and stale entries auto-refresh via a stateless researcher subagent.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="landing-feature">
        <div class="landing-feature-icon">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h5l2 3h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Documentation Structure</h3>
        <p>A canonical layout for all project documentation &mdash; architecture, standards, requirements, research, personas. Every document has a place, and the system enforces it.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="landing-feature">
        <div class="landing-feature-icon">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 21H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4"/><polyline points="16 17 21 12 16 7"/><line x1="21" y1="12" x2="9" y2="12"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Standards Enforcement</h3>
        <p>Define coding standards once. The Reviewer enforces them on every task with specific citations. Verification mode audits that they hold over time.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="landing-feature">
        <div class="landing-feature-icon">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Drift Detection</h3>
        <p>Documentation and code drift apart over time. Verification mode catches it &mdash; comparing doc claims against code reality with severity-classified discrepancies.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>


</div>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
